<view class="section">
  <view class="eyebrow">CUSTOMER SERVICE</view>
  <view class="h2" style="margin-top:10rpx">采购问题统一从客服入口处理</view>
  <view class="section-sub">报价、找货、订单、物流、资质与售后集中在一个服务入口，减少B端客户判断成本。</view>
</view>

<view class="section">
  <view class="service-grid">
    <view class="service-card" bindtap="contact">
      <text class="strong">在线客服</text>
      <text>日常采购、商品信息、订单状态与基础业务咨询</text>
      <view class="link" style="margin-top:18rpx">立即咨询 →</view>
    </view>
    <view class="service-card" bindtap="quote">
      <text class="strong">大单询价 / 缺货找货</text>
      <text>批量采购、专项报价、缺货品种与长期采购需求</text>
      <view class="link" style="margin-top:18rpx">提交需求 →</view>
    </view>
    <view class="service-card" bindtap="contact">
      <text class="strong">订单与物流</text>
      <text>发货进度、物流状态、到货时间与异常签收</text>
      <view class="link" style="margin-top:18rpx">联系处理 →</view>
    </view>
    <view class="service-card" bindtap="afterSales">
      <text class="strong">售后服务</text>
      <text>破损、少货、退换、批号效期与其他订单异常</text>
      <view class="link" style="margin-top:18rpx">查看售后 →</view>
    </view>
    <view class="service-card" bindtap="qualification">
      <text class="strong">资质与账户协助</text>
      <text>客户资质、经营范围、发票资料与采购账户问题</text>
      <view class="link" style="margin-top:18rpx">联系客服 →</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
